WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.692
This slide brings Module 14 together.

00:00:02.692 --> 00:00:06.337
Review the patterns you can now recognize and reuse.

00:00:06.337 --> 00:00:11.772
Focus on the decisions behind the syntax: what structure or method fits the problem,

00:00:11.772 --> 00:00:16.322
what assumptions are being made, and what you should check before trusting the result.

00:00:16.322 --> 00:00:20.117
Machine learning is a workflow rather than a single fit command.

00:00:20.117 --> 00:00:25.602
Keep training information separate from evaluation data, compare against a baseline,

00:00:25.602 --> 00:00:30.067
and interpret model performance in the context of the real prediction problem.

00:00:30.067 --> 00:00:35.827
Before moving on, explain the main idea in one sentence without reading the slide.

00:00:35.827 --> 00:00:41.248
That quick explanation is a useful check that the concept is becoming reusable knowledge.
